    {
      "path": "books/player/Decennium_Descent_Core_Systems_Bible_v2_Known_Descent.docx",
      "part": "word/document.xml",
      "paragraphIndexZeroBased": 8396,
      "text": "Havens may issue stamped claim notes backed by stored cargo. Notes are lighter than coin but become worthless if the haven falls, the issuer dies, or the dungeon changes the vault. Goblin and Aethel factors are the most aggressive issuers because they understand that transport risk can be converted into interest and claims.",
      "textSha256": "fefd3971580c9945f5e603f5565b0382c7852a3be74b3578645cb41def631e38"
    },
    {
      "path": "books/player/Decennium_Descent_Core_Systems_Bible_v2_Known_Descent.docx",
      "part": "word/document.xml",
      "paragraphIndexZeroBased": 8397,
      "text": "34. The External World Economy",
      "textSha256": "4cf393daf189cae39c5995cc0d6c216559220c2d43859b13a1db4a811b1851a2"
    },
    {
      "path": "books/player/Decennium_Descent_Core_Systems_Bible_v2_Known_Descent.docx",
      "part": "word/document.xml",
      "paragraphIndexZeroBased": 8398,
      "text": "Each opening creates a ten-year economic wave. The first days produce panic buying, auctions, theft, and political seizure. The first year converts proven discoveries into industries and military plans. The middle years normalize supply. The final years before reopening produce speculation, debt, expeditions, and counterfeit claims.",
      "textSha256": "8b4f99a57e555d5ca699a0444412b1315fdd8652277eb9c26310eded2d0462c0"
    },
    {
      "path": "books/player/Decennium_Descent_Core_Systems_Bible_v2_Known_Descent.docx",
      "part": "word/document.xml",
      "paragraphIndexZeroBased": 8399,
      "text": "No kingdom can assume that a dungeon-derived technology will remain available. This creates monopolies, hoarding, strategic reserves, substitute industries, and wars over the people who know how an artifact works.",
      "textSha256": "18477c9f1a047bc4c6cbb1efe4fb9e79fbc4f3fad122cfb2e2896587b2a24da3"
    },
    {
      "path": "books/player/Decennium_Descent_Core_Systems_Bible_v2_Known_Descent.docx",
      "part": "word/document.xml",
      "paragraphIndexZeroBased": 8400,
