      "part": "word/document.xml",
      "paragraphIndexZeroBased": 8422,
      "text": "War economy",
      "textSha256": "919ffee49b52b24e81e2c25bcc4917b044388010e4ab56a183555add84c50662"
    },
    {
      "path": "books/player/Decennium_Descent_Core_Systems_Bible_v2_Known_Descent.docx",
      "part": "word/document.xml",
      "paragraphIndexZeroBased": 8423,
      "text": "Mass provisioning, labor movement, caravan concentration",
      "textSha256": "4176626daf9ac880ce06afa4f123cc754838b44e79293e60b624c549d229a7c5"
    },
    {
      "path": "books/player/Decennium_Descent_Core_Systems_Bible_v2_Known_Descent.docx",
      "part": "word/document.xml",
      "paragraphIndexZeroBased": 8424,
      "text": "35. Labor, Captivity, and the Slave Trade",
      "textSha256": "d82243835ab70d1ba72c150842635ec2189487cefec6ed30ba60a5a9d3fec02b"
    },
    {
      "path": "books/player/Decennium_Descent_Core_Systems_Bible_v2_Known_Descent.docx",
      "part": "word/document.xml",
      "paragraphIndexZeroBased": 8425,
      "text": "Slavery exists both into and out of the dungeon. It is an exploitative institution with economic power because transport, labor, danger, and legal identity are central to the setting. These rules do not assign value by race. Markets price skill, health, supernatural capability, legal risk, and control, while characters and factions impose moral and reputational consequences.",
      "textSha256": "1e83b695a3137c4a45a3093cba55accf28cc4e4cc0a7a91f92fae5a1fd9c7a89"
    },
    {
      "path": "books/player/Decennium_Descent_Core_Systems_Bible_v2_Known_Descent.docx",
      "part": "word/document.xml",
      "paragraphIndexZeroBased": 8426,
      "text": "Statuses",
      "textSha256": "b5c3b907a3d2f1a36517931aaf5176568d34947832910eb9e2dd3a3d40821224"
    },
